                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "flute",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woodwind instrument consisting of a tube with a row of holes that produce sound through vibrations caused by air blown across the edge of the holes, often tuned by plugging one or more holes with a finger; the Western concert flute, a transverse side-blown flute of European origin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7596fd2-9629-4ec1-9b85-5e96d2cfa6fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                                "text": "The breathing flute's ſoft notes are heard around, / And the ſhril trumpets mix their ſilver ſound; / The vaulted roofs vvith echoing muſic ring, / Theſe touch the vocal ſtops, and thoſe the trembling ſtring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b37f0858-f05f-4c6f-b4ea-76de2929795c",
                                                "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                                "text": "The group played huge drums placed overhead, along with flutes and a kotolike zither."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97f6e888-d3c4-43f6-b344-2b253a73a903",
                                                "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                                "text": "After another alternation of the two elements, there is a more playful episode, in which flute and bassoon take up the first element, with swooping glissando on the ondes Martenot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27aa9ac4-828f-30e9-adbc-3176817afa3f",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A recorder, also a woodwind instrument."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f223fd28-5a7f-3637-ba51-621987f2feab",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A glass with a long, narrow bowl and a long stem, used for drinking wine, especially champagne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f30f567-222e-41ab-ba98-0538cec547e3",
                                                "sense_id": "f223fd28-5a7f-3637-ba51-621987f2feab",
                                                "text": "These are champagne glasses, says Peggy.\nNo, I mean the tall ones, Jamie says.\nYou're thinking of flutes, says Peggy. These are coupes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5068c873-da76-3193-808a-0ea7b158c68a",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lengthwise groove, such as one of the lengthwise grooves on a classical column, or a groove on a cutting tool (such as a drill bit, endmill, or reamer), which helps to form both a cutting edge and a channel through which chips can escape."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bae2676-eb2b-3e1e-afa9-64996a59f5c4",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A semicylindrical vertical groove, as in a pillar, in plaited cloth, or in a rifle barrel to cut down the weight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "627758ad-d96b-3f1e-95e8-ba69e06049c3",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A long French bread roll, baguette."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9de8d3e8-6634-3398-8877-25412a602fff",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An organ stop with a flute-like sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b14de8a-621e-3f27-a5f6-f3311b01844c",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shuttle in weaving tapestry etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "flute",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23c9da1d-7ddc-3f9b-b82d-d3426f30aced",
                                        "entry_id": "781592b6-34e7-3bcf-96e2-a7630513f667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To play on a flute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca6d9e3f-ed95-39d2-97ed-d0fca03fc733",
                                        "entry_id": "781592b6-34e7-3bcf-96e2-a7630513f667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a flutelike sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06108d45-0988-4a08-a52f-f8c355b2add2",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6d9e3f-ed95-39d2-97ed-d0fca03fc733",
                                                "text": "The green turf was velvet underfoot. The blackbirds fluted in the hazels there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "172ae26a-74fe-3d35-be9c-1f6fea33caf3",
                                        "entry_id": "781592b6-34e7-3bcf-96e2-a7630513f667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter with a flutelike sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "988005e8-e1d1-474b-8aa6-ae7b1de296d1",
                                                "sense_id": "172ae26a-74fe-3d35-be9c-1f6fea33caf3",
                                                "text": "“Oh, there's my precious Poppet,” said Phyllis, as a distant barking reached the ears. “He's asking for his dinner, the sweet little angel. All right, darling, Mother's coming,” she fluted, and buzzed off on the errand of mercy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eaafe1d6-f37a-3e24-9b68-169eecf8a6c8",
                                        "entry_id": "781592b6-34e7-3bcf-96e2-a7630513f667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To form flutes or channels in (as in a column, a ruffle, etc.); to cut a semicylindrical vertical groove in (as in a pillar, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c45fbf3-9c89-4714-8c05-549454544cef",
                        "source_entry_id": "647a3ff0-95af-3fda-8022-85da43859d58",
                        "source_sense_id": "2146cbbc-1e01-36a8-8f3a-0046a7992874",
                        "target_lang_word": "groove",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "groove",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c33ce8b8-cbd3-3a70-b153-ce42811eacac",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A long, narrow channel or depression; e.g., such a slot cut into a hard material to provide a location for an engineering component, a tire groove, or a geological channel or depression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef07b490-e2e8-38a7-988f-00213cd50ccd",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fixed routine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b1460ec-f34c-4a6f-907e-023194666423",
                                                "sense_id": "ef07b490-e2e8-38a7-988f-00213cd50ccd",
                                                "text": "Through these distresses, the Odd Girl was cheerful and exemplary. But within four hours after dark we had got into a supernatural groove, and the Odd Girl had seen “Eyes,” and was in hysterics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7eb6bf33-64a6-45a6-a72d-33d3c12aebe0",
                                                "sense_id": "ef07b490-e2e8-38a7-988f-00213cd50ccd",
                                                "text": "The gregarious trifling of life in the social groove."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84d82455-f7b7-48d3-8c6d-2a65a945f154",
                                                "sense_id": "ef07b490-e2e8-38a7-988f-00213cd50ccd",
                                                "text": "His counterpart Neil Warnock got his tactics spot on as Chelsea struggled to get into any sort of groove in the first half."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa98d754-a610-3e2c-9fd7-e290aca9a8da",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The middle of the strike zone in baseball where a pitch is most easily hit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a058949c-0175-39bc-9dfd-98c31faaeb8f",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pronounced, enjoyable rhythm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5865d050-e302-4a6b-a420-1bbf4c11c3de",
                                                "sense_id": "a058949c-0175-39bc-9dfd-98c31faaeb8f",
                                                "text": "Now, what you hear is not a test, I'm rapping to the beat / And me, the groove, and my friends are gonna try to move your feet"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45df5cf6-3578-4bef-99d0-7251dd1d917a",
                                                "sense_id": "a058949c-0175-39bc-9dfd-98c31faaeb8f",
                                                "text": "Let the music play / He won't get away / This groove he can't ignore"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f6f1407-18eb-441e-95fb-2d4dabd174ce",
                                                "sense_id": "a058949c-0175-39bc-9dfd-98c31faaeb8f",
                                                "text": "Get into the groove / Boy, you've got to prove / Your love to me / Get up on your feet / Yeah, step to the beat"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f693de34-4f52-394d-979a-6527585ff0d3",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A good feeling (often as in the groove)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "839b805c-bd7a-439a-ac1f-d8d2d6ca4f3d",
                                                "sense_id": "f693de34-4f52-394d-979a-6527585ff0d3",
                                                "text": "You can't hide forever, just decide to make it better / Turn it into something good / Remember, you can choose not to lose / Find your groove and be a winner"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "488895a6-9eda-4f8f-8138-fda68084ff13",
                                                "sense_id": "f693de34-4f52-394d-979a-6527585ff0d3",
                                                "text": "How could he be expected to make music that put the audience in a groove, he reasoned, if he wasn't grooving himself?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca6190d5-0fbc-312f-af79-32b935bba6f7",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shaft or excavation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01de609b-e461-35fe-a20f-12ea97841c04",
                                        "entry_id": "deefc8cc-4c8a-3b8b-b9ec-5ef57d149fb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The optimal route around the track, or any of several such routes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "groove",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af081611-326d-3bf0-84e0-59e72f4989eb",
                                        "entry_id": "9b288888-8a93-39c1-b95b-9a187e01ab15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cut a groove or channel in; to form into channels or grooves; to furrow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29e22854-f317-49c6-baa5-02c1da0381b9",
                                                "sense_id": "af081611-326d-3bf0-84e0-59e72f4989eb",
                                                "text": "The path to my fixed purpose is laid with iron rails, whereon my soul is grooved to run."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61cf35fa-abbb-351a-8258-112d9b2bb4a3",
                                        "entry_id": "9b288888-8a93-39c1-b95b-9a187e01ab15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform, dance to, or enjoy rhythmic music."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a5ef4ab-b0d5-42dd-b9c8-3976a8e0c81b",
                                                "sense_id": "61cf35fa-abbb-351a-8258-112d9b2bb4a3",
                                                "text": "I was just starting to groove to the band when we had to leave."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
